  "approver_enrollment_model": {
    "note": "Q1: a TokenBoundAndApproved proof's ADDITIONAL (approver) logical signer groups bind to their OWN enrolled keys, NOT the credential cnf (credential-profile \u00a75). The authority holds an off-wire approver enrollment record keyed by CRYPTOGRAPHIC CONTENT \u2014 the group's signer-suite record thumbprint (suite_id + ordered public keys), the same content-bound discipline as cnf/M1 \u2014 never the attacker-chosen group_id or kid. It is validated for role, active status, tenant coherence, and a non-negative integer enrollment_epoch. Unknown, key/suite-mismatched, revoked/inactive, or cross-tenant/role-mismatched enrollment denies. Not a credential/wire claim; no allocation.",
